.Dd November 21, 2026
.Dt JOBMARSHAL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm jobmarshal
.Nd per-user build coordination
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm help
.Nm
.Cm version
.Nm
.Op Fl h | Fl -help | Fl -version
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
provides command-line information for the Jobmarshal project.
With no arguments, it exits successfully without output.
.Ss The help command
The
.Cm help
command prints usage information, available commands, and the homepage.
The
.Fl h
and
.Fl -help
options provide the same information.
.Ss The version command
The
.Cm version
command prints the version and copyright information.
The
.Fl -version
option provides the same information.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
Invalid arguments produce exit status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
The project homepage is
.Lk https://github.com/jmmv/jobmarshal .
Report issues at
.Lk https://github.com/jmmv/jobmarshal/issues .
